 distinct sense of humor. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not much of an extrovert, you know. I never go on blind dates. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Just remember to relax and be yourself.  You guys will have a great time!"}, {"time": "33500", "image": "engenn6le07ob01re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Is she going to call me or something? Or should I call her?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: She's expecting your call at around 9 tonight.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, man! I'm nervous ... </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Don't be. It'll be great! You guys are going to have a super time.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ok, give me her number. I'll call her later. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Awesome! The movies starts at 8 tomorrow. Don't be late picking her up."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Goes on a Blind Date"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Blind Date"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Grammar - part 3 > Are You Tracy?"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le07ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li> <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li> <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li> <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It'll be great.</br> I'll call her later.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm going to a movie tomorrow.</br> You guys are going to have a super time.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She's expecting your call at around 9 tonight.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The movie starts at 8 tomorrow.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "distinct"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very different"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has a distinct sense of humor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le07ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you describe people's personalities and behaviors."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "killer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very attractive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has a killer smile."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le07ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extrovert"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who is very active, lively, and friendly "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm not much of an extrovert, you know."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le07ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apprehensive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "being afraid that something bad may happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you feeling a little apprehensive?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le07ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "consistently"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do the same thing all the time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I know someone who consistently goes to the movies on Friday nights."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le07ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Prepare a dialogue (10-12 sentences) about what you are doing now and what you are doing next week."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss your future plans with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I can write a dialogue about my present and future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can share my dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can discuss my future plans with my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can listen to my partner share their plans."}]}]}